#: v4/includes/admin-help.php:31
msgid ""
"In the <a href=\"%s\">WP RSS Aggregator knowledge base</a> you will find comprehensive details and tutorials on how to use the core plugin and all the add-ons.\n"
"\n"
"                            There are also some videos to help you make a quick start to setting up and enjoying this plugin."
